    "media:imagetext": "NEW SERVICE\nTO PALM SPRINGS\nQuick Reference Schedule\nEffective December 23, 1987\nPSA\nSan Francisco\nRESERVATIONS (415) 956-8636\nLeaves Arrives Flight\nFreq.\nVia/Stops\nM\nLeaves\nArrives\nFlight\nTo PALM SPRINGS\nFrom PALM SPRINGS\n9:20a 10:44a 1878\n12:51p\n11:10a\n12:35P\n1899\n2:10p 1890\n2:35p\n4:00p\n1909\nM-Meal Service\nFreq.\nVia/Stops\nPSA INTRODUCES A HOT\nTICKET TO THE DESERT\nPALM SPRINGS\nNow you can take advantage of\nour new nonstop service to Palm\nSprings.\nCatch our convenient morning and\nmid-day flights. Whichever flight you\ntake you'll fly in comfort because\nPSA's seating arrangement gives\n80% of our passengers a window or\naisle seat.\nAnd PSA's Frequent Flyer Program is\na fast, easy way to free trips world-\nwide and more.\nNobody serves California like\nCalifornia's airline - PSA. For\ninformation and reservations, call\n(415) 956-8636, 1-800-I-FLY-PSA or\nyour travel consultant today.",
